@startuml sequenceDiagram
    participant W as "Writer Thread"
    participant R as "Reader Thread"
    participant M as "Mutex"
    participant C as "Condition Variable"

    Note over R: Preparing to wait
    R->>M: lock()
    activate R
    R->>R: Check condition (it's false)
    Note over R: Is about to call wait()
    deactivate R

    Note over W: Update is ready
    W->>M: lock()
    activate W
    W->>W: Update shared data
    Note over W: Now, W does a premature unlock
    W->>M: unlock()
    deactivate W

    Note over M,C: The Race! The mutex is unlocked, and W sends notify.
    W->>C: notify_all()
    Note over C: The signal is sent, but R is not yet waiting!
    
    activate R
    R->>C: wait()
    Note over R,C: R is now in wait state.
    deactivate R
    Note over R: R is now blocked forever (or until next update)
    R-->>R: Zzzzz...